  "ai_usage": "Scanning, searching, or 'finding nearby' states. The wedge is conic-gradient(var(--c) 0 18deg, transparent 18deg) inside a circular clip; the rings are repeating-radial-gradient so the whole thing stays one element plus a blip.",
  "path": "effects/loaders-spinners/radar-sweep-loader.html",
  "source": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Radar Sweep</title>\n  <script type=\"application/json\" id=\"effect-meta\">\n  {\n    \"id\": \"radar-sweep-loader\",\n    \"title\": \"Radar Sweep\",\n    \"summary\": \"A conic wedge sweeps a ringed radar screen and lights up a blip.\",\n    \"description\": \"A conic gradient wedge rotates over concentric rings and cross-hairs; a single blip fades in each time the beam passes it.\",\n    \"theme\": \"loaders-spinners\",\n    \"categories\": [\"loader\", \"ambient\"],\n    \"tags\": [\"radar\", \"sweep\", \"conic-gradient\", \"scan\", \"sci-fi\"],\n    \"tech\": [\"css\"],\n    \"era\": \"2020s\",\n    \"difficulty\": \"intermediate\",\n    \"dependencies\": [],\n    \"browser_support\": \"All modern browsers (Chromium, Firefox, Safari).\",\n    \"performance_notes\": \"Lightweight — composited transform/opacity work only.\",\n    \"accessibility_notes\": \"Decorative status indicator — pair it with a visually-hidden aria-live message so screen readers announce the wait. Motion stops under prefers-reduced-motion.\",\n    \"customization\": [\n      { \"name\": \"--c\", \"description\": \"Beam color\", \"default\": \"#34d399\" },\n      { \"name\": \"--dur\", \"description\": \"Sweep period\", \"default\": \"2.4s\" }\n    ],\n    \"variations\": [\"Multiple blips at different radii\", \"Slow the sweep for an ambient background\", \"Square radar for a HUD look\"],\n    \"ai_usage\": \"Scanning, searching, or 'finding nearby' states. The wedge is conic-gradient(var(--c) 0 18deg, transparent 18deg) inside a circular clip; the rings are repeating-radial-gradient so the whole thing stays one element plus a blip.\"\n  }\n  </script>\n  <style>\n    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    html, body { height: 100%; margin: 0; }\n    body { display: grid; place-items: center; background: #0b0d12; color: #e7ebf3;\n      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif; overflow: hidden; }\n    :root { --c: #34d399; --dur: 2.4s; }\n    .radar { position: relative; width: 130px; aspect-ratio: 1; border-radius: 50%; overflow: hidden;\n      background: repeating-radial-gradient(circle, transparent 0 20px, color-mix(in srgb, var(--c) 22%, transparent) 20px 21px), #08120e;\n      border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--c) 40%, transparent); }\n    .radar::before { content: \"\"; position: absolute; inset: 0;\n      background: conic-gradient(color-mix(in srgb, var(--c) 55%, transparent) 0 22deg, transparent 22deg);\n      animation: spin var(--dur) linear infinite; }\n    .radar .blip { position: absolute; top: 32%; left: 66%; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%;\n      background: var(--c); box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--c); animation: blip var(--dur) linear infinite; }\n    @keyframes spin { to { transform: rotate(1turn); } }\n    @keyframes blip { 0%, 18% { opacity: 1; } 60%, 100% { opacity: 0; } }\n    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n      * { animation: none !important; transition: none !important; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"radar\" role=\"status\" aria-label=\"Scanning\"><span class=\"blip\"></span></div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
}
